\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus the good Shepherd is;
\par Jesus died the sheep to save;
\par He is mine, and I am His;
\par All I want in Him I have,
\par Life, and health, and rest, and food,
\par All the plenitude of God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus loves and guards His own;
\par Me in verdant pastures feeds;
\par Makes me quietly lie down,
\par By the streams of comfort leads:
\par Following Him where'er He goes,
\par Silent joy my heart o'erflows.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He in sickness makes me whole,
\par Guides into the paths of peace;
\par He revives my fainting soul,
\par Stablishes in righteousness;
\par Loves me still-I know not why!
\par  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Love divine shall still embrace,
\par Love shall keep me to the end;
\par Surely all my happy days
\par I shall shall in Thy temple spend,
\par Till I to Thy house remove,
\par Thy eternal house above!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

